  "guarantee": "For one exact closed declared policy, one exact caller-supplied boundary observation record whose provenance is caller_asserted, and one exact captured subject set, the package-owned transformer measures every subject under the declared closed unit and measurement-class lexicon, derives the complete N-1/N/N+1 census for every nonzero limit and the exact N/N+1 census for a zero maximum, validates every recorded disposition against the complete declared table, and emits complete populations, exact counts, associations, and one canonical report bound to the exact source-set digest.",
